tive) would have caused strong sentiment shifts. Specifically, the "Contrarian Capitulation" regime, which looks for "capitulation" type news combined with technical bottoming signals, likely contributed to profitable entries during extreme fear, as evidenced by the strategy's resilience in the stress regime.	N/A	[0.044848654,0.018133184,-0.064646296,-0.030419998,-0.006773019,0.031494673,-0.035131354,-0.005630161,0.02963239,-0.0900473,-0.029647844,0.054448172,0.01679084,-0.00051195704,-0.014540496,-0.015399045,0.062309925,-0.06638643,0.0048100743,0.018424736,-0.013429572,0.020493448,0.008604589,0.017046308,0.030140454,0.021112261,0.040279396,-0.021355383,-0.00408345,0.22092804,0.0030854717,-0.06944677,-0.0067046843,0.047283746,-0.025568038,0.016384702,0.016274096,0.011816612,0.006562271,-0.010337594,-0.0005682577,0.021731727,0.05664266,0.037030805,0.035960406,-0.049955774,0.010078036,0.016262107,-0.006926299,0.010778133,-0.0044053444,-0.004939424,0.03026717,-0.004266432,0.020866474,0.031401955,0.0061267205,0.0071614264,0.04560932,-0.010876266,-0.044838015,0.02580297,0.098244265,-0.030926285,0.059253674,-0.00067311863,0.0025087583,0.007997435,0.020551924,-0.02249249,-0.0040820227,-0.01819627,-0.018085832,-0.021153184,-0.03257789,-0.050638065,-0.018605242,0.014673624,-0.017181855,0.05884698,-0.0023019607,-0.02383941,-0.031993393,0.0296439,0.02523903,0.07699891,0.027158793,-0.020416405,0.021904906,-0.036504827,0.052027155,-0.0049003963,0.02783063,0.008896772,-0.012643653,0.0024268012,0.00041996283,-0.005094422,-0.020729817,0.028450795,-0.054596048,-0.015986286,0.01767205,0.0051288097,-0.0056383405,-0.028201485,-0.016403252,0.061891504,-0.0059869513,0.04713348,-0.023428522,-0.25440624,0.0021776669,-0.018851832,-0.05542647,-0.04489859,0.073369786,0.021784054,-0.0068160435,-0.023231983,-0.00016901472,0.029997295,0.026060818,0.024093263,-0.014777869,-0.0045067794,0.023019796,0.01629846,-0.005700546,-0.01860839,-0.0007014973,-0.0016599415,0.017535167,-0.05781393,0.0448235,0