VID crash if the sentiment was overwhelmingly negative (e.g., "black swan" at -4.0, "systemic risk" at -4.0). Similarly, keywords like "euphoria", "mania", "irrational exuberance", and "extreme greed" (all with negative weights) are designed to trigger sells or prevent buys at market tops. If these signals were too early or too late, they could lead to missed opportunities or premature exits, though the high win rate in normal conditions suggests they generally worked as intended for closed trades. The "strong jobs report" (0.5) is a nuanced keyword, reflecting its ambiguous impact on markets (good for economy, bad for inflation/rates), which could lead to cautious "HOLD" decisions if other indicators are mixed.	N/A	[0.02689187,0.03810497,-0.046175763,-0.028133294,-0.001607758,0.043564998,-0.016771538,-0.010317948,0.025446739,-0.09780858,-0.017384084,0.044084765,-7.469608e-05,-0.0020212817,-0.03323706,-0.004112518,0.048517182,-0.052608177,-0.0063357474,0.0016236859,-0.018378103,0.0075337193,0.025457904,0.024265453,0.021546604,0.028134504,0.019184034,-0.013682395,-0.0031968672,0.21567595,0.01920473,-0.056231137,-0.011258703,0.026845159,-0.042803362,0.038991667,0.0003525331,-0.010648095,0.026720611,0.018231321,0.016003946,0.026577234,0.053983986,0.04627506,0.036238212,-0.048341524,0.0077054715,0.019693738,-0.009214791,0.02779433,-0.009432495,-0.016390847,0.013111217,-0.0043458887,0.030735275,0.053203527,0.0008378171,-0.02115209,0.036540005,0.006608961,-0.04691359,0.025307849,0.080149256,-0.014459012,0.057442605,-0.00085270446,0.011307292,0.0053359563,0.035569575,-0.014412983,0.02326982,7.8545e-06,-0.020966938,-0.017563611,-0.03037423,-0.048457216,-0.021409536,0.004654017,-0.019778779,0.031961255,0.010843706,-0.026781864,-0.018897373,0.03598565,0.0055053,0.063380234,0.012039524,-0.0120284315,0.010600594,0.0032581622,0.028091485,-0.017357599,0.050335877,-0.008234042,-0.0003827724,-0.0027832624,-0.009075746,-0.016024979,-0.022260562,0.018814072,-0.08200221,0.017457027,0.